## Summary

When a VS Code server exists on the agent server, the VS Code tab should be shown regardless of whether the backend is cloud or local. When VS Code is not available on a local agent server, the tab should still appear but display a helpful unavailability message with actionable setup guidance.

Currently, the VS Code tab is **hidden entirely** for non-cloud backends:

